   "hook",
   "Panama used to be part of Colombia.",
   "Panama used to be part of Colombia."
  ],
  [
   "why",
   "It broke away for one big reason: a canal."
  ],
  [
   "strip",
   "This thin strip is the shortcut between two oceans."
  ],
  [
   "no",
   "In 1903, Colombia's Senate rejected America's canal deal.",
   "In nineteen oh three, Colombia's Senate rejected America's canal deal."
  ],
  [
   "revolt",
   "So when Panama declared independence, the United States backed it."
  ],
  [
   "ship",
   "An American warship stood guard, and Colombia's troops got stuck in Colón.",
   "An American warship stood guard, and Colombia's troops got stuck in Coh-lone."
  ],
  [
