   "Fifteen days later, a treaty gave America a ten-mile strip across Panama, forever."
  ],
  [
   "back",
   "The canal opened in 1914. Panama got it back in 1999.",
   "The canal opened in nineteen fourteen. Panama got it back in nineteen ninety-nine."
  ],
  [
   "end",
   "Today the canal is Panama's, not Colombia's, even though"
  ]
